{"id":"fe577fb2b2dc26d9","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-boolean-algebra.md","title":"Boolean Algebra","display":"df-boolean-algebra — Boolean Algebra","type":"definition","metadata":{"numbering_status":"local atom identifier; not the book result number","source_verification":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified","type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-boolean-algebra","aliases":["17-df-boolean-algebra"],"display":"df-boolean-algebra — Boolean Algebra","depends_on":["[[17-df-set-functions]]","[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","legacy_label":"17-df-6.1.2b","local_revision":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"numbering_status","html":"local atom identifier; not the book result number"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"pending exact book correspondence; local formulation reviewed, not source-verified"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-boolean-algebra"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-boolean-algebra</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-boolean-algebra — Boolean Algebra"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-6.1.2b"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"content audit of supplied 17(1).zip; inherited source_verification and bibliographic fields not independently reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>有限序列编码、自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2\">\\(2\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B^2\">\\(B^2\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b6e4a36b436c9b93\" href=\"?note=b6e4a36b436c9b93\" title=\"17-df-ordinals-finiteness\">17-df-ordinals-finiteness</a>；二元运算的输入使用该有限序列编码，而不是集合论有序对。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_B,\\vee_B\">\\(\\wedge_B,\\vee_B\\)</span> 为候选二元运算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg_B\">\\(\\neg_B\\)</span> 为候选一元运算，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_B,1_B\">\\(0_B,1_B\\)</span> 为候选元素。函数与有序元组见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\wedge_B y\">\\(x\\wedge_B y\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\vee_B y\">\\(x\\vee_B y\\)</span> 分别表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge_B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(\\wedge_B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee_B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\">\\(\\vee_B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak B\">\\(\\mathfrak B\\)</span> 为候选六元组；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Boolean}\">\\(\\mathrm{Boolean}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BA}\">\\(\\operatorname{BA}\\)</span> 在此完整定义。不额外假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_B\\neq1_B\">\\(0_B\\neq1_B\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;0_B,1_B\\in B\\land\\wedge_B:B^2\\to B\\land\\vee_B:B^2\\to B\\land\\neg_B:B\\to B\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in B\\;\\Bigl[\n(x\\wedge_B y)\\wedge_B z=x\\wedge_B(y\\wedge_B z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(x\\vee_B y)\\vee_B z=x\\vee_B(y\\vee_B z)\n\\land x\\wedge_B y=y\\wedge_B x\\land x\\vee_B y=y\\vee_B x\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land x\\wedge_B(y\\vee_B z)=(x\\wedge_B y)\\vee_B(x\\wedge_B z)\n\\land x\\vee_B(y\\wedge_B z)=(x\\vee_B y)\\wedge_B(x\\vee_B z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land x\\wedge_B(x\\vee_B y)=x\\land x\\vee_B(x\\wedge_B y)=x\n\\land x\\wedge_B1_B=x\\land x\\vee_B0_B=x\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land x\\wedge_B0_B=0_B\\land x\\vee_B1_B=1_B\n\\land x\\wedge_B\\neg_B(x)=0_B\\land x\\vee_B\\neg_B(x)=1_B\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{BA}(\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\;\n\\Bigl[\\mathfrak B=\\langle B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;0_B,1_B\\in B\\land\\wedge_B:B^2\\to B\\land\\vee_B:B^2\\to B\\land\\neg_B:B\\to B\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in B\\;\\Bigl[\n(x\\wedge_B y)\\wedge_B z=x\\wedge_B(y\\wedge_B z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land(x\\vee_B y)\\vee_B z=x\\vee_B(y\\vee_B z)\n\\land x\\wedge_B y=y\\wedge_B x\\land x\\vee_B y=y\\vee_B x\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land x\\wedge_B(y\\vee_B z)=(x\\wedge_B y)\\vee_B(x\\wedge_B z)\n\\land x\\vee_B(y\\wedge_B z)=(x\\vee_B y)\\wedge_B(x\\vee_B z)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land x\\wedge_B(x\\vee_B y)=x\\land x\\vee_B(x\\wedge_B y)=x\n\\land x\\wedge_B1_B=x\\land x\\vee_B0_B=x\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land x\\wedge_B0_B=0_B\\land x\\vee_B1_B=1_B\n\\land x\\wedge_B\\neg_B(x)=0_B\\land x\\vee_B\\neg_B(x)=1_B\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{BA}(\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\exists B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\;\n\\Bigl[\\mathfrak B=\\langle B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\rangle\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>补齐原输入中只在 Remark 提及、实际由缺失外部谓词承担的全部布尔代数运算律。保留六分量编码及既有 BA 接口，不引入布尔值满足关系等额外机制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-set-functions]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-ordinals-finiteness","status":"resolved","id":"b6e4a36b436c9b93","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"有限序列编码、自然数 $2$ 与 $B^2$ 见 [[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]；二元运算的输入使用该有限序列编码，而不是集合论有序对。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$B$ 为集合；$\\wedge_B,\\vee_B$ 为候选二元运算，$\\neg_B$ 为候选一元运算，$0_B,1_B$ 为候选元素。函数与有序元组见 [[17-df-set-functions]]。$x\\wedge_B y$ 和 $x\\vee_B y$ 分别表示 $\\wedge_B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)$ 与 $\\vee_B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)$。$\\mathfrak B$ 为候选六元组；$\\mathrm{Boolean}$ 与 $\\operatorname{BA}$ 在此完整定义。不额外假定 $0_B\\neq1_B$。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"2","display":false},{"tex":"B^2","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_B,\\vee_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\neg_B","display":false},{"tex":"0_B,1_B","display":false},{"tex":"x\\wedge_B y","display":false},{"tex":"x\\vee_B y","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge_B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\vee_B(\\langle x,y\\rangle)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Boolean}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BA}","display":false},{"tex":"0_B\\neq1_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\n\\leftrightarrow{}&0_B,1_B\\in B\\land\\wedge_B:B^2\\to B\\land\\vee_B:B^2\\to B\\land\\neg_B:B\\to B\\\\\n&\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in B\\;\\Bigl[\n(x\\wedge_B y)\\wedge_B z=x\\wedge_B(y\\wedge_B z)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land(x\\vee_B y)\\vee_B z=x\\vee_B(y\\vee_B z)\n\\land x\\wedge_B y=y\\wedge_B x\\land x\\vee_B y=y\\vee_B x\\\\\n&\\quad\\land x\\wedge_B(y\\vee_B z)=(x\\wedge_B y)\\vee_B(x\\wedge_B z)\n\\land x\\vee_B(y\\wedge_B z)=(x\\vee_B y)\\wedge_B(x\\vee_B z)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land x\\wedge_B(x\\vee_B y)=x\\land x\\vee_B(x\\wedge_B y)=x\n\\land x\\wedge_B1_B=x\\land x\\vee_B0_B=x\\\\\n&\\quad\\land x\\wedge_B0_B=0_B\\land x\\vee_B1_B=1_B\n\\land x\\wedge_B\\neg_B(x)=0_B\\land x\\vee_B\\neg_B(x)=1_B\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\operatorname{BA}(\\mathfrak B)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\exists B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\;\n\\Bigl[\\mathfrak B=\\langle B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B\\rangle\\\\\n&\\hspace{18mm}\\land\\mathrm{Boolean}(B,\\wedge_B,\\vee_B,\\neg_B,0_B,1_B)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":2454,"backlinks":[{"id":"ba828dd62ddf0d50","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak B=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle$ 是 [[17-df-boolean-algebra]] 的 Boolean algebra。"},{"id":"906faf39b94540bc","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak{B}=\\langle B,\\wedge,\\vee,\\neg,0,1\\rangle$ ($\\operatorname{BA}(\\mathfrak{B})$, see [[17-df-boolean-algebra]])"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-aleph-o